摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"Markdown-native AI mind maps and visual thinking for DeepSeek Harness.","id":"gh:1343016152","install_available":true,"language":"JavaScript","name":"dsh-mindmap","slug":"guhanfei-ai/dsh-mindmap","topics":["ai-agent","deepseek-harness","dsh-plugin","knowledge","markdown","mindmap","visualization"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Markdown-native AI mind maps and visual thinking for DeepSeek Harness."},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-mindmap"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"简体中文"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"A DeepSeek Harness plugin that turns a plain Markdown file into a live mindmap. The working director"},{"id":"p4s2","text":"y is the document: the chat is the editor, the AI edits the `.md` step by step, and the right-side f"},{"id":"p4s3","text":"loating panel re-renders the mindmap in real time."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"> Project status: pre-1.0. The current feature set (see CHANGELOG) is implemented and covered by uni"},{"id":"p5s2","text":"t tests, but cross-version compatibility beyond the development environment is not yet certified."},{"id":"p6s1","text":"## The core idea"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"- Open a Markdown file — it **is** a mindmap.\n- The chat is not the main character; it is the assist"},{"id":"p7s2","text":"ant that edits the mindmap next to you.\n- You say one sentence, the AI edits the `.md` one step, the"},{"id":"p7s3","text":" panel follows instantly.\n- Mindmap = Markdown: diffable, shareable, and git-friendly by nature."},{"id":"p8s1","text":"## Features"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"- **Four tools** (`mindmap_create` / `mindmap_open` / `mindmap_get` / `mindmap_update`) — plain Mark"},{"id":"p9s2","text":"down files in the session working directory; the root node title is the filename and stays in sync b"},{"id":"p9s3","text":"oth ways (`renameRoot` renames the file, collisions are rejected).\n- **Live panel with zero extra ch"},{"id":"p9s4","text":"annels** — the panel consumes the session snapshot (`mindmap_*` tool results), so every AI edit re-r"},{"id":"p9s5","text":"enders immediately.\n- **Reliable open, recoverable loading state** — AI create/open results always e"},{"id":"p9s6","text":"xpand the panel (a structural-fingerprint selector drives snapshot recomputation even when the host "},{"id":"p9s7","text":"reuses the nodes array reference); clicking a `.md` first reads it through the local read-only route"},{"id":"p9s8","text":", while AI fallback loading still recovers from case-only path mismatches, inline tool errors, and a"},{"id":"p9s9","text":" ~30s watchdog timeout with one-click retry.\n- **Refresh from disk** — 刷新脑图 reloads the current file"},{"id":"p9s10","text":" while preserving drafts and attachments, without submitting a model request. Fresh disk content sta"},{"id":"p9s11","text":"ys visible until a later tool result arrives; overlapping reads, closing, and session changes cannot"},{"id":"p9s12","text":" let an old request replace the new view. Failed refreshes retain the canvas and show a retryable er"},{"id":"p9s13","text":"ror.\n- **Draft protection** — uses the host's published input snapshot for text, references, and att"},{"id":"p9s14","text":"achments. Pending or unreadable input is preserved; files still open through the read-only route and"},{"id":"p9s15","text":" editing commands remain available for manual submission.\n- **Graceful parse failure** — if a docume"},{"id":"p9s16","text":"nt's Markdown ever breaks the parser, the panel never crashes: the mindmap area shows an explicit pa"},{"id":"p9s17","text":"rse-failed state with the error, the original file is left untouched, and you can switch back to the"},{"id":"p9s18","text":" directory tab or let the AI fix the content and reopen. Normal documents never reach this path.\n[该节"},{"id":"p9s19","text":"ctory tab or let the AI fix the content and reopen. Normal documents never reach this path.\n[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"## Where new mindmaps go"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"When you ask for a mindmap without naming a location — \"创建一个脑图\", \"把刚才的讨论整理成脑图\", \"盘点一下这个问题\" — the fil"},{"id":"p11s2","text":"e lands in **`.mindmaps/`**, the mindmap inbox:"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"- The **默认脑图命名是否添加AI工具标记** setting is on by default. The marker identifies the user-facing host tool"},{"id":"p13s2","text":", **DSH**, not its selected model, engine, or provider. Turning it off restores `YYYYMMDD-HHmmss-<de"},{"id":"p13s3","text":"scription>.md`. This only affects future generated names; explicit user titles and existing files st"},{"id":"p13s4","text":"ay unchanged. A create already awaiting confirmation keeps the naming plan shown in that confirmatio"},{"id":"p13s5","text":"n.\n- The `YYYYMMDD-HHmmss` stamp is read by the host from the real clock; the model only supplies th"},{"id":"p13s6","text":"e short description (cleaned and truncated to 24 characters). Two captures in the same second get `-"},{"id":"p13s7","text":"2`, `-3`, … suffixes — an existing file is never overwritten, and the write-confirmation names the e"},{"id":"p13s8","text":"xact file it is about to create.\n- The path is checked twice: once when the confirmation is drawn, a"},{"id":"p13s9","text":"nd again against the filesystem right before the write. If the target directory moved or was swapped"},{"id":"p13s10","text":" for a symlink while you were reading the confirmation, the create is refused instead of writing out"},{"id":"p13s11","text":"side the session working directory.\n- `.mindmaps/` is created on first use, not at install time. The"},{"id":"p13s12","text":" directory tree shows it as **脑图收件箱（.mindmaps）**, because a dotted folder otherwise reads as tool re"},{"id":"p13s13","text":"sidue.\n- Nothing is added to `.gitignore` for you. A mindmap stays an ordinary Markdown file: review"},{"id":"p13s14","text":" it, diff it, commit it, or move it somewhere permanent.\n- Say the location instead and it is respec"},{"id":"p13s15","text":"ted: `docs/架构脑图.md`, `planning/迭代计划.md`, or right-click a folder in the tree and choose 在此目录新建 Markd"},{"id":"p13s16","text":"own 脑图. An explicit directory is never rewritten into the inbox (and still has to stay inside the se"},{"id":"p13s17","text":"ssion working directory).\n[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"## Requirements"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"| Component | Baseline |"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"| Node.js | 20.11 or newer |\n| DeepSeek Harness | tested against `0.1.1-rc.2`, `0.1.2-rc.1`, and `0."},{"id":"p16s2","text":" 20.11 or newer |\n| DeepSeek Harness | tested against `0.1.1-rc.2`, `0.1.2-rc.1`, and `0.1.5-rc.1` |"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"Input, settings, and conversation contracts from `0.2.0-rc.2` / `0.2.1-alpha.1` have offline regress"},{"id":"p17s2","text":"ion coverage; this does not certify every host workflow. API requests retain the page's base path fo"},{"id":"p17s3","text":"r reverse-proxy deployments and enforce the page's origin."},{"id":"p18s1","text":"## Installation"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"Development (link install, live source):"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"Released tag:"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"Exact npm version:"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"New-version cooldown policies can affect package selection shortly after publication. Check the actu"},{"id":"p25s2","text":"al installed version in plugin management; use an exact version when needed."},{"id":"p26s1","text":"## Tools"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"Mindmap requests go directly to these four native `mindmap_*` tools. No skill discovery or loading i"},{"id":"p27s2","text":"s needed: `find-skills` and `workbuddy-mindmap` are not part of this plugin's workflow. The AI guida"},{"id":"p27s3","text":"nce and new/open commands explicitly request native tools only, without external scripts or generic "},{"id":"p27s4","text":"file-write substitutes. A failed tool call is reported, not bypassed through a different tool."},{"id":"p28s1","text":"| Tool | Description |"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"## Development"},{"id":"p31s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p32s1","text":"The browser implementation is maintained under `src/client/` and assembled into the single `client.j"},{"id":"p32s2","text":"s` entry required by DeepSeek Harness. Edit the source fragments, then run `npm run build:client`; d"},{"id":"p32s3","text":"o not hand-edit the generated entry."},{"id":"p33s1","text":"[该节后续省略]"}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
